  "sn35.206:1.1": "cakkhuṃ bhikkhave aniccaṃ paccuppannaṃ. ",
  "sn35.206:1.2": "yadaniccaṃ taṃ dukkhaṃ ",
  "sn35.206:1.3": "yaṃ dukkhaṃ tadanattā ",
  "sn35.206:1.4": "yadanattā taṃ netaṃ mama nesohamasmi na meso attāti evametaṃ yathābhūtaṃ sammappaññāya daṭṭhabbaṃ …pe… ",
  "sn35.206:1.5": "jivhā aniccā paccuppannā. ",
  "sn35.206:1.6": "yadaniccaṃ taṃ dukkhaṃ ",
  "sn35.206:1.7": "yaṃ dukkhaṃ tadanattā ",
  "sn35.206:1.8": "yadanattā taṃ netaṃ mama nesohamasmi na meso attāti evametaṃ yathābhūtaṃ sammappaññāya daṭṭhabbaṃ …pe… ",
  "sn35.206:1.9": "",
  "sn35.206:1.10": "",
  "sn35.206:1.11": "",
  "sn35.206:1.12": "",
  "sn35.206:1.13": "evaṃ passaṃ …pe… ",
  "sn35.206:1.14": "nāparaṃ itthattāyāti pajānātīti. "
